This product includes software developed as part of the Open Agent Assurance
companion project.

The raucle adapter interfaces with raucle, which is licensed separately;
raucle itself is NOT distributed in this repository and must be installed
from the pinned v0.23.5 distribution (see packages/raucle-adapter/README.md).

This project includes example instrumentation against the OpenTelemetry
Python SDK and OpenInference semantic conventions (Apache-2.0), and a
docker-compose file adapted from Langfuse v4.74.0 (MIT Expat; the Langfuse
ee/ tree is under a separate commercial licence — see
https://github.com/langfuse/langfuse).

The Raucle Console UI previously vendored Tabler v1.7.3 (MIT licence); that
vendor tree was removed in the UI-02.3 quiet-SaaS rebuild and the shell now
styles itself from its own design-token layer (static/tokens.css) plus
static/app.css, with no third-party CSS.

The Raucle Console UI also vendors the Inter variable font (latin subset,
static/vendor/fonts/inter-latin-var.woff2), which is licensed under the SIL
Open Font Licence, Version 1.1; see
services/console/static/vendor/fonts/licence-Inter-OFL.txt for the licence
text and https://github.com/rsms/inter for the upstream source.
